flowchart TD
  A([Member notices an issue]) --> B[Navigate to /disputes\nClick File Dispute]
  B --> C[Fill form: category\ndescription + evidence file]
  C --> D{File attached?}
  D -->|Yes| E[Upload to Pinata IPFS\nCID returned and stored]
  D -->|No| F[Dispute without evidence]
  E --> G
  F --> G[POST /api/disputes\nStatus: OPEN\nvotingDeadline = now + 72h]
  G --> H[Notifications sent\nto all group members]
  H --> I{Members vote\nwithin 72h}
  I -->|Member votes| J{Already voted?}
  J -->|Yes| K([Rejected — one vote per member])
  J -->|No| L[DisputeVote recorded]
  L --> I
  I -->|Deadline reached| M{Admin force-resolve?}
  M -->|Yes| N[POST /api/admin/disputes/id/resolve]
  M -->|No — auto| O{Quorum met?\nMajority UPHELD?}
  O -->|UPHELD majority| P[Dispute → UPHELD]
  O -->|REJECTED majority| Q[Dispute → REJECTED]
  O -->|No quorum| R[Auto-resolved: REJECTED]
  N --> S[Dispute closed\nAll parties notified]
  P --> S
  Q --> S
  R --> S
  S --> T([Dispute closed])
